window.products.push({"id":795056,"name":"soges 3 Pieces Kitchen Dining Table Set for 4, Breakfast Table Set with 2 Benches, Wooden Dinette with Wine Shelf and Glass Holder, White Oak 10CZWKDS","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":109.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WS2rbNp4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Sturdy Construction】: This kitchen table set are made of high-quality wood and metal frame, ensuring its load-bearing capacity and long lifespan. The bottom robust connecting bar of the bench adds extra stability while providing a place to rest for your feet. 【Practical Storage】: With simple but practical design, this wood kitchen dinner table features wine glass hoder steel hooks under the table for wine or beverage and 2 layer wood shelves with various function. The top wine bottle holder rack is used to fix bottles on the top shelf while the bottom storage shelve could place food, snack or other daily supplies, meetting your different demands. 【Dimensions】: The practical table set includes a 47.24L x 23.62W x 29.53H inch table and 2 pcs 25.98L x 10.63W x 17.32H inch bench, perfectly suitable for family members to gather together in the kitchen or dining area. Enjoy a warm and pleasant family reunion time. 【Space-saving Design】: Both benches of this 3 piece dining room table set can be conveniently tucked under the table, making these benches space-saving in limited space while avoiding unexpected tripping. And you could slide the bench seats out for quick seating when using them, maximizing the home space and provideing convenience for you. 【Multi Function】: This kitchen table and bench for 4 could be widely used as a computer table,dining desk,office table,writing workstations,office workstation,study table, writing desk, gaming desk,bistro table set,etc.Easy assembly with detailed installation manual and organized packaging.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WS2rbNp4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"soges","source_asin":"B09TYS2S1M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-795056","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TYS2S1M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TYS2S1M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":795057,"name":"Lifeforce Glass The Serenity Prayer Inspirational Glass Plaque. Encouraging and Centering Words to Empower. Includes a Folding Easel Seafoam.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71W8zuiulNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"God grant me the serenity to accept the things I cannot change, courage to change the things I can, and the the wisdom to know the difference. This prayer benefits us all and imprinted on a beautiful glass plaque, it makes a perfect gift. The Serenity Prayer serves as guidance for young people, support for those in recovery, and comfort for anyone facing a challenge. The glass tile is three inches wide and six inches tall. It comes with a black, folding metal easel. It will make a beautiful addition to anyone's decor. The color is seafoam. A beautiful blue green color.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71W8zuiulNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lifeforce Glass","source_asin":"B07G8NJLSY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-795057","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07G8NJLSY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07G8NJLSY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
