window.products.push({"id":795079,"name":"Luxury Sheets Full Size Bed Set Soft 100% Cotton Cooling Sheets Deep Pockets Snug Fit Elastic, 500 Thread Count, 4-Piece Sheet Set, Hotel Quality, Dam","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715PIi-LmQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ready to Sleep in Luxury? Transform your sleeping experience with our luxurious 500 thread count bed sheets, made from 100% cotton sateen. In addition to comfort and fit, our damask striped sheets enhance the overall look of your bed. Experience the ultimate softness, comfort, and breathability that you deserve, for a good night's sleep that leaves you feeling refreshed and energized in the morning. Upgrade your bedroom with our queen sheet set cotton for a luxurious sleep. Confused About Thread Counts? Investing in new bed sheets is a big decision. But with so many brands making unverifiable egyptian cotton claims, it can be overwhelming to know which one to trust. Our independently certified 500 thread count luxury sheets guarantee a smart investment. Durable, comfortable, and made to last for years, you can sleep soundly knowing you made the right choice. Get the perfect fit with our striped sheets for queen size bed. Experience the Ultimate in Comfort and Health: These lightweight and airy sheets wick away moisture and promote deep, restful sleep. Perfect for hot sleepers, they're naturally cool and skin-friendly. We use extra long staple cotton which makes them soft and buttery to the touch. Built to last, these luxurious Italian-inspired sheets will leave you feeling refreshed and rejuvenated every morning. Get the best sleep with our light gray cotton bed sheets queen. Tired of ill-fitting sheets? Our fitted sheet is designed to fit mattresses up to 16 inches deep. No more bunching or popping off corners! With durable all-around elastic and a head/foot indicator for easy bed-making, you'll love the convenience. Our 4-piece queen-size set includes true-to-color, stain-free, fade-free, hole-free, and fuzzball-free fabric. You'll get the comfort you deserve for years to come! We Promise You'll Love These Sheets: Wall Street Journal confirms that \"California Design Den's Cotton Sheets are as soft and well-made as other cotton sheets costing more than three times their price.\" Our sheets are machine washable, easy to maintain, and Oeko-Tex certified for your safety. Plus, if you're not satisfied, you can return them within 30 days for a full refund. Get extra deep pocket queen sheets for a perfect fit.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715PIi-LmQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"California Design Den","source_asin":"B07J4VLS7Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-795079","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07J4VLS7Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07J4VLS7Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":795080,"name":"Sunnydaze Solid Pine Kitchen Sideboard Cabinet with 2 Drawers and 2 Doors - 31.5 Inches H - White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":249.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81T6fLwLfYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ample storage: This sideboard buffet measures 36\" W x 17\" D x 31.5\" H, weighs 46.2 lbs, and has an overall weight capacity of 130 lbs. It features two 14\" W x 5.25\" H drawer fronts and two 13\" W x 11\" D x 4.5\" H interiors. Each drawer has a weight capacity of 30 lbs. This kitchen base cabinet also has two doors that measure 14\" W x 17\" H x 0.5\" thick each. The tabletop is 0.5\" thick. It also features an adjustable 32.5\" W x 10.5\" D shelf with a weight capacity of 40 lbs. Classic design to complement any decor: This rustic farmhouse cabinet is made of solid pine for lasting strength and beauty. The hinges and the drawer and door pulls are made from zinc alloy for an antique appearance. The drawers also feature steel slides for smooth opening and closing. It has a stylish two-tone design with a semi-transparent, white finish to showcase the natural woodgrain and a pine tabletop. Great for kitchen, dining room or living room: This sturdy freestanding console cabinet is designed for indoor use. All of the hardware required for assembly is included. Two-person assembly is recommended, and a hammer, rubber mallet, and a Philips screwdriver are required for assembly (not included). Store a variety of items: This sideboard features 2 drawers and 2 lower cabinets. Use the drawers to store silverware, napkin rings, small craft supplies, and kitchen tools. The lower cabinet is great for storing pots, pans, cooking sheets, bowls, and plates. Easily adjust the shelf and choose between 3 height options: 5.75\", 8.25\" and 10.25\" from the bottom of the cupboard. The flat tabletop also provides a convenient surface for serving and entertaining. Worry-free purchasing: Sunnydaze Decor backs its products with a 1-year manufacturer's warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81T6fLwLfYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sunnydaze","source_asin":"B0C7LK1NWB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-795080","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C7LK1NWB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C7LK1NWB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
