window.products.push({"id":795134,"name":"FASDUNT Handheld Vacuum, 8000Pa Wet Dry Hand Vac with LCD Display & Charging Dock, Lightweight Portable Hand Vacuum Cordless Rechargeable, for Home, O","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71obF9yCryL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【8000Pa Ultra-Strong Suction】FASDUNT hand vacuum cordless rechargeable adopt 2021 Newest 100W power motor, can provide more than 8000Pa ultra-strong suction, which allows to easily pick up dirt, crumbs, and pet hair from the home, car, and office with outstanding cleaning performance. Features ECO and MAX modes, it's better to meet your different cleaning needs 【3-layer Filtration with 2 HEPA Filters】FASDUNT car vacuum cleaner uses an upgraded 3-layer filtration system, including an air outlet sponge, filter holder, and Washable HEPA filter, which can capture can capture 99.99% of microparticles, can effectively protect the motor, maintain suction and prevent secondary air pollution. Moreover, there is an extra filter in the package 【Portable Wet Dry Handheld Vacuum】FASDUNT car hand vacuum is combined with Wet-Dry use and 3 different nozzles, makes it effectively to vacuum the dust, pet hair from the floor, carpets, or corners, and clean the spilled liquid from the desk or hard floor with ease. (Note: The liquid does not exceed 100ml in this dust cup). Comes with pretty packaging, makes it a perfect Thanksgiving/Christmas/New Year Gift for your family or friend 【2-3h Super Rapid Charging】FASDUNT wet dry hand vacuum comes with a 4 x 2200mAh rechargeable & detachable battery pack and uses the latest fast-charge tech, only takes 2-3 hours to fully charge (Faster than another handheld vacuum). provides up to 20-30 mins running time and allows the battery pack to be charged separately 【Innovative Smart LCD Display】The car vacuum cleaner designed with a thoughtful LCD display， for showing the battery power and 2 modes in real-time while using or charging, provides you a smarter and more convenient cleaning experience. And FASDUNT also offers a 2 in 1 storage & charging stand, which makes charging easier and keep your home tidy and organized","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71obF9yCryL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FASDUNT","source_asin":"B08YNJ6G2C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-795134","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YNJ6G2C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YNJ6G2C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
