window.products.push({"id":795155,"name":"ETS Drawstring Tea Filters - Pack of 100 (Medium - 2 pack, White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LHyYCS0qL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"These Drawstring Tea Filters are the perfect accompaniment for your loose leaf tea. Simply scoop your favorite loose leaf tea into the tea bag, pull the drawstring tight to close the bag, and place it in your mug and add hot water. It'll keep the tea in the filter, the water in your cup, and the smile on your face. The filters are made from wood pulp and heat sealing fiber and are 100% biodegradable and organic. You will have your choice of 3 shapes of the drawstring tea filters in either white or natural color. Size: Each box contains 100 drawstring tea filters. Choose from: Medium: 2.68 inches L x 1.93 inches W Large: 3.125 inches L x 2.68 inches W -- The wide mouth makes it easy to get the loose tea into the bag. Large Funnel: 3.875 inches L x 2 inches W (bottom) x 3.125 inches W (top) -- The wide mouth makes it easy to get the loose tea into the bag.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LHyYCS0qL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"English Tea Store","source_asin":"B01BFV8XMY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-795155","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01BFV8XMY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01BFV8XMY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
