window.products.push({"id":795201,"name":"SUPERIOR Cotton Flannel Sheet Set & Pillowcases, King Pillowcases, Teal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.14,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1nntsh4TdS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sleep in pure comfort with the Fleur-de-Lis Pillowcase Set. Crafted from quality, 100% Cotton Flannel, this lovely duo is the perfect blend of soft, thick, and durable. These pillowcases boast an enchanting scrolling floral pattern representative of a timeless fleur-de-lis design that adds a luxurious accent to your bed. Available in festive colors of charcoal, desert sand, navy blue, and teal, this duo instantly updates any bedroom. The luxurious texture and soothing colors blend wonderfully and complement your space. Add matching sheets and duvet cover sets, or mix and match solid with floral for a complete look.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1nntsh4TdS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUPERIOR","source_asin":"B09HR5WT5K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-795201","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HR5WT5K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HR5WT5K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
