window.products.push({"id":795217,"name":"Premium Quality - Almond Milk Bag - XL - 13 \" X 13 \" - Smoothie Strainer - Food Strainer - Cold Brew Coffee Maker- Free Recipes Included - Reusable - ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cvPTUArjL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"OVER 900 AMAZON 5-STAR REVIEWS - Amazon customers know better than anyone, our nut milk bag is the top 5-star reviewed and purchased nut milk bag for a reason. It's simple, customers love it and keep coming back. Every day we get emails sending us photos of them making nut milk and loving it. There's no need to compare. Amazon customers have consistently chosen Zimtal as their favorite nut milk and bag, and we hope you will, too. 75 MICRONS PROFESSIONAL FOOD GRADE NYLON - America's leading raw food experts love the Zimtal Nut Milk Bags since it creates the now famous \"perfectly smooth nut milk\" consistency. Competitor nut milk bags use a 200 micron mesh count, which is a grade originally used to filter paint in automotive shops, and is too tight for nut milk since it filters out the majority of the nutrients. Save yourself the disappointment of flavourless and watery nut milk. The 75 micron count is the perfect nylon thread count to create the most delicious nut milk you've ever tried. SAVE MONEY AND TIME - Read through our over five hundred 5-star reviews and you'll see for yourself how many creative ways our customers use our nut milk bag: cold-brew coffee, sprouting, seed milk, greek yogurt, cheese, iced tea, and homemade juice. One customer even saved 600 USD and uses the Zimtal nut milk bag to strain blended fresh juice instead of buying a new Vitamix—smart guy! NO MOLDY BAGS - Our nut milk bag is easy-to-clean, dries very quickly, and keeps your kitchen healthy. Cotton bags or thicker bags (200 microns) will stay wet for much longer and get moldy fast. Who wants to drink milk from a moldy bag? By sticking with a 75 micron count bag that is made out of nylon, not cotton, you are setting yourself up to win with your new diet decisions. FREE 2-DAY SHIPPING REPLACEMENT BAGS — If your nut milk bag tears, breaks, or wears out for any reason at all in the next 365 days, we'll send you a new FREE bag with 2-day Amazon Prime shipping. We stand behind our products and our #1 priority is 5-star customer service. We believe that making healthy diet choices should be fun, and we work hard to make being a Zimtal customer an absolute pleasure. It's our 100% enthusiastic satisfaction and money-back guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cvPTUArjL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zimtal","source_asin":"B00KU5SSEU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-795217","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KU5SSEU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KU5SSEU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
