window.products.push({"id":795236,"name":"No-See-Um mesh Square Mosquito Net for King Size Bed 2 Openings Netting Mosquito Net for Beds, Finest Holes Mesh 2000 Mosquito Netting for Bed (Square","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812m7cELYzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Material: Our no see um mesh mosquito net, unconventional net mesh with more than 2,000 holes per square inch, the highest standard in industry. It meets all the criteria of the World Health Organization (WHO), specifications. Designed for maximum resistance against bursting, good airflow and visibility. Light Gray Color and Coffee Color meshes absorbs much less heat and offers good airflow and higher visibility than black mesh. Sizes: 85” L x 77” W x 80” H, 25oz/710g. Suitable for king size bed. This premium mosquito net is bigger than most other nets to fit perfectly over outdoor tables and chairs, porch swings, cribs, picnic tables and more. The classic rectangular style design maximizes coverage with minimum weight and packaged size. Advantage: Mosquito net for beds are washing machine safe. The edging design of the opening makes the mosquito net fit better without curling. It gives more freedom to move than ordinary tents or Shelter bags. This mosquito tent fits easily into your backpack and carry-on boarding luggage, set up and fold it all by themselves when they go to scouts. Pack: The 8 points hanging system don' t require special skills, for home and travel. You can hang it from the corners of your four-post bed or any tree branch for an added touch of style and elegance. The height can be adjusted freely according to your needs. When it's set up properly, it is a large box-shape, and definitely big enough to cover a full-sized mattress. Extra string and a carry pouch. Super lightweight and easy to travel within your carry-on luggage. Function: This mosquito netting is suitable for indoor and outdoor. The mosquito net serves as a natural insect protection. Not treated with chemicals.This netting is perfect for all your travel adventures such as camping trips, hiking, even used in your backyard watching the stars. And protected you from mosquitoes, noseeums, flying insects, bees, ladybugs and other pesky bugs while you sleep outdoors.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812m7cELYzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aventik","source_asin":"B09YH9P5BW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-795236","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YH9P5BW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YH9P5BW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
