window.products.push({"id":795330,"name":"Plush Extra Thick Pillow Top Full Size Mattress Topper for Firm Mattress, Soft & Cooling Hotel Bed Topper for Back Pain with Natural Cotton Cover, Ove","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51o4IWT4O6L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"EXTRA THICK MATTRESS TOPPER WITH 3INCH LOFTINESS. Our extra thick full size mattress topper with its 3inch gusset filled with 110oz soft & plush down alternative fiber adds an extra layer of softness to your firm mattress providing you the bouncy feel and cloud-like sleep comfort. PILLOW TOP MATTRESS TOPPER FOR BACK PAIN RELIEF. Filled with premium quality 3D & 6D plush microfiber, this generously filled mattress topper finds a good balance between softness and cushioning and offers optimized support for your hips, shoulders, back, and knees to avoid back ache and leaves you feeling well rested when morning comes. COOLING & BREATHABLE MATTRESS TOPPER. Encased in the softest, lightest and breathable 100% cotton fabric, our mattress topper retain less heat and maintains optimal temperature. No more sweaty nights caused by memory foam pads or traditional mattresses SECURE FIT & BOX QUILTING CONSTRUCTION. Our mattress topper with 4 corner elastic straps adapts to mattress depths from 6\" to 22\" and ensures a secure fit and allow you toss and turn freely. The box quilting construction prevents the evenly distributed fillings from shifting as you sleep to offer you the most consistent comfort. TIPS FOR USE. It is not necessary to wash your pillowtop before use as it is clean. For best results, tumble dry it on a low heat before use to fluff up the fibers. To extend your bed topper’s life and reduce the need to wash it, position a mattress protector/ fitted sheet over it. Wash bi-annually in a front loader machine on a cool wash. *Please do not use a top loader machine as the agitators destroy the fibers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51o4IWT4O6L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"D & G THE DUCK AND GOOSE CO","source_asin":"B09QFPVK9T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-795330","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QFPVK9T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QFPVK9T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
