window.products.push({"id":795390,"name":"YiRonCins 3Pcs White Artificial Chrysanthemum Flowers, 27\" Long Stem Spider Mums Boho Faux Flowers Bouquets Silk Spring Flowers with 9 Flower Heads fo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81f4wWJ8bzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Real Touch Silk Faux Flowers: Flower petals are made of high quality silk, also it is coated with some latex, which makes the flowers real touch and and lifelike as real ones. The powder planting technology is adopted to create a natural frosty green in leaves, all the long stems are covered with realistic flocking, these details are carefully designed to simulate real plants. Long Stems Artificial Flowers: Each box come with 3 pieces of artificial flowers spider mums, and each one totally 27inches in height with 3 flower heads,one flower head approx 4.7 inches in diameter,one around 3.6 inches and one is 2.8 inches.13 inches long stems will look beautiful in a big floor vase or tall jar, if the stem is too long for your vase, you can easily cut it or bent it. Versatile in Many Occasion: Artificial chrysanthemum flowers is suitable for flower arrangements, centerpieces.Perfect for home decor, wedding, office, living room, bathroom, coffee table, and any other place that you want to decorate. It is also the perfect gift for your parent and friends. Save Time and Money: Growing the fresh flowers may take a lot of time and effort, and purchasing them can be costly, so artificial flowers are becoming a more popular option for home, office, and even wedding decorations now, because they no maintenance or upkeep required, they will never fade and die, stay fresh and beautiful all the time. Warm Tips: Please order more boxes if you want larger bouquet with more flowers, you can mix with other colors. Due to convenient transportation, we will fold the stems. Please don't worry, it is flexible, you can bend it back when you receive it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81f4wWJ8bzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YiRonCins","source_asin":"B0BW3G5J7H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-795390","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BW3G5J7H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BW3G5J7H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
