window.products.push({"id":795466,"name":"Kids Sleep Training Alarm Clock, White Noise Sound Machine with 9 Sounds&Lullaby, Night Light,Dimmer,Nap Timer, Plug in/Battery Powered Time to Wake D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-U0BEyeZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"⏰【CUTE & MULTI-FUNCTIONAL ALARM CLOCK】Charming design cute alarm clock for kids sleep trainer is boasting multi function. 9 soothing lullabies accelerating your baby into sweet dream, 7 color changing night lights helping your kids feel safe when sleep in the dark, wake up green light making children wake up naturally, 3 alarm modes, wake and nap timer, adjustable dimmer(5-levels) and alarm volume(15-Level) to choose as your kids like, 2 power modes: AC powered & battery, 12/24 H & DST. ⏰【3 ALARM MODES WITH ADJUSTABLE DIMMER & VOLUME】3 alarm modes to choose for different use: “ALARM”, “WAKE” & “NAP”. When the “ALARM” time takes effect, the clock will only ring but not light up. When “WAKE” time, it will only glow green and flash but not ring. Green means time to wake up. When “NAP” time, it will ring and light up. The brightness(5-level) of LCD time is adjustable by pressing “DIMMER” button and the volume of alarm & sleep sounds(15-Level) by sliding button \"ALARM VOLUME\". ⏰【CHILDREN'S SLEEP TRAINER with AUTO-OFF】The adorable clock features 9 high quality lullabies & 7-colored night light to soothe your child to sleep. Volume & displaying time of lullabies can be adjusted as your kids like to help them fall asleep faster. Just tap left \"toe\" to change night light and be best all-night companion for kids to keep them feeling safe. AUTO OFF for Saving Energy-7 colors night light will be turned off automatically after 30 mins, LCD display OFF within 30 secs. ⏰【FUN FACES, NAP TIMER, SNOOZE, 12/24H, DST & EASY TO SET】If your kids wake up earlier, they can play the funny facial animations with the press of right \"toe\" to stay in bed longer for parents more sleep. The NAP can be set a count down alarm, using for kids a lunch break. Press left \"toe\" to get SNOOZE for 9 mins of sleep, press right “toe” to turn off alarm for 24 H. Press “12/24H” button to change time format & hold press “DST” button to change DST. Intuitive buttons make set-up easily. ⏰【SURPRISE KIDS GIFT & 2 POWER MODES 】Perfect gift for your kids & families, suitable for Birthday, Christmas, Festival etc. The kids alarm clock not only teaches kids when it’s time to wake up but also grows with families by helping them get more sleep, and also help kids be independent. AC powered & battery(4* 1.5V AA).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-U0BEyeZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mesqool","source_asin":"B07N1HYZ9Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-795466","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07N1HYZ9Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07N1HYZ9Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
