window.products.push({"id":795587,"name":"Wallies Wall Decals, Baby Sunshine Wall Stickers, Includes 2 Sheets","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819aZS9umqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Wallies Sunshine Sky decals are an easy and adorable way to bring color into a kids room without the hassle of painting or hanging art that leaves holes in the wall. These non-permanent, removable wall decals for boys and girls are high quality and sure to put a smile on your little one's face! Decal measurements: Sun decal measures 17\" x 16\" Sun decal measures 17\" x 16\" Cloud decals measure 2\" x 3\" to 17\" x 10\" Cloud decals measure 2\" x 3\" to 17\" x 10\" Bird decals measure 3\" x 2-1/2\" Bird decals measure 3\" x 2-1/2\" Wallies Vinyl Wall Decals Enjoy decorating your walls with our wide variety of peel and stick, vinyl-coated decals to suit any theme you desire. Wallies are a fast and easy way to decorate a child’s room, home office, kitchen - transform any blank, boring flat surface! Wallies are a great alternative to decorating with paint or stencils. And because Wallies are removable and repositionable, they aren’t permanent like paint is so you can change your room's décor quickly and painlessly! In just a few minutes, you can really update your surroundings. About Wallies Every Wallies design is made of durable, self-adhesive backed vinyl that can be removed and repositioned easily. To use, simply peel the pieces off of their backing and apply to any clean, smooth surface. Vinyl decals for the pantry, home office and playroom Vinyl decals for the pantry, home office and playroom Change your room décor in seconds Change your room décor in seconds Removable and repositionable Removable and repositionable Easy to remove, safe for most surfaces Easy to remove, safe for most surfaces Leaves no sticky residue Leaves no sticky residue We offer an extensive variety of Wall Play items, such as alphabets, solar systems and dinosaurs, which are educational and fun. Kids love to interact with these products, easily arranging them for hours of fun. Wallies has wonderful wall decor for kids in a variety of designs for babies’ rooms and for kids’ rooms, and more grown-up designs for living rooms, dining rooms and kitchens. From growth charts and murals, to message chalkboards and chalkboard labels, from playful fantasy to needed utility, Wallies has something for everyone in easy-to-use, easy-to-reuse, decals. With Wallies…. The possibilities are endless! Product Disclaimer: Only authentic Wallies Peel & Stick Wall Decals are manufactured and shipped from the United States in Wallies branded packaging.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819aZS9umqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wallies","source_asin":"B00B9DGAZ6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-795587","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00B9DGAZ6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00B9DGAZ6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
