window.products.push({"id":795728,"name":"Oneida Michelangelo 3-Piece Hostess Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41HHJH9NE0L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description The great masters of the Renaissance captured every detail, down to the finest degree. The ornate design of Michelangelo also boasts such intricate sophistication for formal dining and entertaining. Oneida, the leading name in flatware, has been setting tables for generations. Oneida's highest quality stainless steel flatware, the 3-piece hostess set includes large serving spoon, gravy ladle and sugar spoon. Amazon.com As graceful as silver but much more convenient, this three-piece Michelangelo hostess set from Oneida adds a beautiful ornate element to the table. The set includes a serving spoon, a sauce ladle, and a sugar spoon, each with a decorative design that runs halfway up the handle and reappears in a flourish at the neck. Elegant cutouts add an airy touch, and the bright mirror finish on the working ends contrasts beautifully with the handles' antiquing. The pieces are even detailed on the back. Crafted from 18/10 stainless steel, the flatware is 18 percent chrome for corrosion resistance and 10 percent nickel for luster. It is safe in the dishwasher and carries a lifetime warranty. Michelangelo is also in Oneida's Patterns for a Lifetime program, so you can expand your collection forever. --Emily Bedard What's in the Box Hostess serving set. Set includes: serving spoon; sauce ladle; sugar spoon. 3 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41HHJH9NE0L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oneida","source_asin":"B0000AZUP2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-795728","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000AZUP2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000AZUP2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
