window.products.push({"id":795793,"name":"Disposable Air Fryer Liners - Round Parchment Paper For Air Fryer Basket, Baking, Frying, Food Grade,100pcs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51DVf0MGtnL._AC_.jpg","description":"Looking for premium-quality paper liners to protect your air fryer? Whether it's French fries, pizza, or onion rings, you can count on an air fryer to help you achieve that perfectly golden crisp and crunch with minimal oil. Maximize your device's functionality and longevity by using a parchment paper liner. This disposable paper tray is inserted into the bottom of your appliance. Because it is exposed to high heat, moisture, and other elements, you need to invest in sheets that are heavy-duty and resilient against heat. Our Air Fryer Liner Sheets are a must-have for your culinary creations. Made of food-grade parchment paper, these air fryer trays help protect your appliance from oil, water, or grease leaking from your food. The raised edges help stop bits from sticking to the inner walls of the air fryer. The liners come in a standard 6\" diameter–that's sized just right to fit most air fryers so you won't need to trim or cut the sheets. Spend more time enjoying your meals and less time scrubbing stubborn residue away. With these parchment paper baskets, you can cut your cleaning time in half. They'll catch any crumbs, meat, and vegetable bits that would otherwise fall through the holes of the basket. After cooking, just remove the insert and dispose. Easy peasy. Not just for air fryers, these paper baskets are also useful for baking pans and cookie sheets. The bowl shape makes them easy to pick up, letting you serve chips, fries, and chicken wings straight from the fryer to your table. These paper trays withstand heat and moisture so they won't become soggy or tear easily. More reasons to use our liner sheets for air fryers: - Stackable, space-saving design - Long-lasting supply - Easy to use Make cleaning and maintaining your air fryer an absolute breeze. Add the Air Fryer Liner Sheets to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51DVf0MGtnL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B0BGCJH4HZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-795793","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGCJH4HZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGCJH4HZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":795794,"name":"Royal Therapy Queen Memory Foam Pillow,Bamboo-Adjustable Shredded Odor-Free Pillow for Neck & Shoulder Pain Relief, Support for Back, Stomach, Side Sl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DIzgFToBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Eliminates pressure points - Royal Therapy largely considered to be the most versatile and comfortable pillows for sleeping you can buy. It's filled with shredded memory foam that gently cradles your head and neck, relieving pressure that often leads to aches and pains. The shape of the contour pillow fills in the gap between your neck and the mattress, keeping your spine in proper alignment while you snooze. Best spinal alignment – our luxury cervical firm pillow gives greater resistance under the heaviest parts of the head and equally supports the lighter more pressure sensitive neck area. Royal Therapy memory foam pillow helps reduce tossing turning and discomfort. It allows your muscles to relax properly offering natural spinal support to your body adjusting to your unique shape promoting a deep restful sleep. Helps with good sleep - it is commonly believed that the spinal alignment also aligns the airways better allowing easier breathing at night. The lack of pressure points during sleeping with Royal Therapy cervical pillow may also be a benefit to those with sleeping problems as there is less tossing and turning. This leads to sound restful sleep. BAMBOO COVER- Bamboo cover is constructed with heat dissipating technology that eliminates thermal build-up while you sleep. Extra durable and aesthetic pillow - Royal Therapy Memory Foam Pillow retains its shape so it will not go flat like traditional pillows. Royal Therapy special foam conforms to fit the neck and head but as it is cooling it reverts to its original shape. Memory foam returns to its shape reliably again and again. It will outlast other high quality pillows simply by design.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DIzgFToBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Royal Therapy","source_asin":"B0BNB5J6MF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-795794","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNB5J6MF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNB5J6MF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
