window.products.push({"id":795980,"name":"Dinosaur Party Favor Bags 12Pack, Dinosaur Birthday Party Supplies Decorations for Boys and Girls, Goodie Bags for Kids Gift, Drawstring Backpack Bag ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+N2NSruGL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"🎒 KIDS’ FAVORITE DINOSAUR BAGS!: You get a set of 12 drawstring backpacks for your little ones during their dinosaurs themed birthday parties or as prizes for school games and activities. Buy these special dinosaur bags for your baby boys or girls, they can use them as their regular daily bags to daycare or school and store toys, pens, crayons, stickers, clothes, trinket dish,snacks and more. 🎒 LIGHTWEIGHT BUT STRONG BAGS FOR BOYS AND GIRLS:Compared with other heavy backpacks,this bag only weighs 0.04 pounds.It is so lightweight and soft that it can greatly reduce the heaviness and burden to protect kids’ shoulders and vertebral region.Also,these bags are made of polyester that are super sturdy so kids can use it everyday and choose different dino patterns for different occasions! 🎒 TOP QUALITY WITH GREAT DESIGNS:These cool bags are delicate but durable,which can load at least 4.4 pounds.Besides,they are machine washable and are colorfast so they won’t bleed to other fabrics or fade. Choose these adorable and reusable backpacks is definitely not a waste of money but a reduce of use of paper and single use plastic bags!With an ASTM F963 International Toy Standard Certificate and CPSIA safety standard. 🎒 PERFECT GIFT FOR MULTI-FUNCTIONAL USE: These bags will be eye-catching in your planned dinosaurs themed birthday parties, baby showers, or arts and crafts activity. Not only can they be used as party favors, as Christmas gifts and as gooddies and loots storage bags,but also they can be daily carry-on bags! Great easter basket stuffers for teens 2022, easter gifts for kids, graduation party favor supplies 🎒 CREATE SURPRISES FOR YOUR SWEETHEART- You can use these as regular bags, goody bags, loot bags,treat bags or even as a gift to your kids, pupils, nieces, and nephews. Dinosaurs will always be on trend so these bags are ideal all year round. Add it to cart now with holiday promotions!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+N2NSruGL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tirafal","source_asin":"B07WT2SP9H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-795980","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WT2SP9H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WT2SP9H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":795981,"name":"MOGI'S Premium Velvet Hangers - Pack of 50 - Black - Copper/Rose Gold Hooks - Non-Slip, with Bonus Accessory Bar- Great for Suits, Pants, Dresses (Bla","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511hz3TJbbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MOGI’S brings you Luxurious Design High Quality Heavy Duty Non-Slip Velvet Hangers at an Affordable Price! Supreme Quality Combined Thicker and Stronger than Standard Velvet Hangers. These Velvet Hangers - Pack of 50 - Black - Copper / Rose Gold Hooks - Non-Slip, with Bonus Accessory Bar- Great for Suits, Pants, & Dresses - by Mogi's help you saving more than half the closet space compared to wood or plastic.They have can hold suits and outerwear securely with its heavy duty strength. Key Features: * These hangers measure 17.5\"x0.2\"x9\" inches and come in our beautifully designed box for easy transport.With Top Quality Material: ABS Plastic, Nylon Flocked, Rose Gold Hook* Ultra slim & lightweight design for space saving * Non slip and luxurious velvet material* Holds heavy winter coats easily*The additional accessories bar(tie bar) on the hanger makes it easy to pair your favorite tie, belts, scarf, or other accessory in one single matching outfit.* Can hold large capacity from 5kg to 8kg(11lbs to 18lbs)* Conserve a tremendous amount of precious closet space* Swivel Rose Gold Hooks can be 360 degree rotated* The gentle curves Notched Shoulders of the hanger preserve the shape of your clothing, unlike regular hangers The set makes a great gift! With this pack of 50 velvet hangers with Rose Gold finish, Premium Velvet Hangers - Pack of 50 - Black - Copper / Rose Gold Hooks - Non-Slip, with Bonus Accessory Bar- Great for Suits, Pants, & Dresses - by Mogi's, you can replace all your regular hangers at once. Perfect for dresses, suits, shirts, skirts, trousers & more. NOTICE : Please be sure to purchase the right hanger color and hook color you like. Package Includes: 50 x Velvet Hangers ★★★★★ RECOMMENDED BY MANY HAPPY CUSTOMERS ★★★★★ \"No more wooden hangers! These keep clothes from falling off by the velvet.\" Betty","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511hz3TJbbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MOGI'S","source_asin":"B074Y6Q7HK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-795981","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074Y6Q7HK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074Y6Q7HK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
