window.products.push({"id":795985,"name":"LOVFIVE Duvet Cover King, 3 Piece Bedding Duvet Cover Set, Comforter Cover with 2 Pillow Shams, Washed Microfiber Bedding Set for All Season (Navy Blu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71t9R2IbGPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What is a duvet cover? A duvet is a cover place over your existing comforter. So you put the entire comforter inside of the duvet. It keeps your comforter, quilt, or pillow clean and you can change up the colors without purchasing a new comforter,Our set brings just the right amount of silky smooth and softness to any bed. Why choose our duvet cover set? 1.Made from 110-percent polyester microfiber, the duvet set offers long-lasting strength, a natural resistance to shrinking and wrinkles, and a noticeably soft hand feel. 2. Lightweight, breathable, hypoallergenic and cool to the touch, Our soft bedding will create a serene sleeping experience for you and your family.  3.Easy to put on and off from the comforter, keep the comforter clean and health.  4. Protection for our precious comforter from scratch of dogs or cats.  5. Simple style, solid color, help you change the style of you bedroom.  6. Zipper closure easliy make you put insert in duvet, Metal zipper is stronger and not easily damaged Product Specification： Material： Made of washed microfiber,moderate thickness,fine clothe &breathable ,soft & close-fitting,even suitable for naked sleeping people.Healthy printing and dyeing, high color fastness.Please feel free to wash,no wrinkle & fade. Size and Color Information:  TWIN: 1 duvet cover set (68\"x 90\"), 1 pillow Case (20\"x 26\") QUEEN: 1 duvet cover set (90\"x 90\"), 2 pillow Cases (20\"x 26\") KING: 1 duvet cover set (104\"x 90\"), 2 pillow Cases (20\"x 36\") Color 1: Navy Blue Color 2: Classic Grey Package included:  1* Washed Microfiber Duvet Cover  2 *Pillow Shams (Not include comforter and filler) We’re always dreaming up new ways to help you sleep well and get that extra bit of comfort throughout the day, Our duvet cover set can satisfied your need!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71t9R2IbGPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LOVFIVE","source_asin":"B08FC3NPB1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-795985","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FC3NPB1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FC3NPB1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":795986,"name":"Bee House Ceramic Small Sugar Bowl (White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616oAdmXfmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These simple, elegant, Bee House (Zero Japan) ceramic porcelain sugar bowls are functional and easy to keep clean, with a replaceable/removable lid and stainless spoon included. Dishwasher safe. Zero Japan ceramic products are manufactured in the Gifu prefecture, the center of Japanese ceramics for many centuries. The Bee House name is used in North America and was inspired by a group of dedicated people working closely together to create well-designed, simple, and functional products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616oAdmXfmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bee House (Zero Japan)","source_asin":"B00E1SF264","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-795986","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00E1SF264","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00E1SF264","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
